	(text "R51-R78 fabbed with 2-2.2M instead of the intended 33E.
2.2M in series with these CMOS-input lines (LATCH/SCLK/BLANK/
A0-A4/RGB data) low-pass filters the edges far too slowly for
HUB75 timing at any usable clock - display was unusable until
hand-reworked to ~33E. U17 (12MHz osc, separate defect: bad
rework joint) also had to be bypassed via the FPGA's internal
HFOSC+PLL. Fixed in hardware and here 2026-08; carry 33E into
the next fab run instead of stuffing 2.2M again."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 275.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5e1b2a3c-7f4d-4a9e-9c2b-1d6e8f3a0b71")
	)
