	(text "The clock input pin (35), the spi cs (11), \nand the ledg ( pin 37 ) have some specificities.\nFor some fpga design you have also to take care of which pairs of IO end up on a given IO site because of shared control lines to the IOB but for the hub75 driver I specifically made sure that all IOs use the same control signals/clocks to make sure that's never an issue.\nSCK output on a line that's not in any \"diff pair\""
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 252.73 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4986 1.4986)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "933cbdaf-abff-476b-9093-7a44e90560d6")
	)
